      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `41f9fc8aa2ef9095e43e3b98a1f70e700b77153d4762b1106cb784bf7160d29d--criminal-courts-australia-2010-11-cube-8-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | a024a51a84cfe597f2031475231531dc4ea75639940f33d88f102be5352c1f79 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | bad47026013b9e8d9bc4dac9bac958bd6e0441f17d9db567ba9e11bdb8ea91c4 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | ce61c35ccc359b3e1860544e0d078307ba0a82dd3aa595820c34288ac8b9a225 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | f4e36004ab64a1afd4dc931f6c1352ad136f257fcae43ac8eed40b8224ab1802 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | cd651072b2a4beae5d0eae6b56d25ea267c98db1cc9fa9efaf03ee10b85682fc | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 7f5b45ed898d6ea9517ab575d260e4dd5d00a9d92acac001ee82f15da4a47e81 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
